### Aegis Sentinel API — Local HTTP Client Requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@orgId = a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890
@workspaceId = f8e7d6c5-b4a3-9281-7065-43210fedcba9

### 1. Register Organization & Admin User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationName": "Acme Cyber Security Corp",
  "organizationSlug": "acme-cyber",
  "workspaceName": "Production Operations",
  "workspaceSlug": "prod-ops",
  "email": "admin@acme-cyber.cloud",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd2026!",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

###

@accessToken = {{register.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{register.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 2. Login User
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme-cyber.cloud",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd2026!"
}

### 3. Get Current Authenticated User Context
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Refresh Access Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. Link OAuth Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/auth/link-account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@acme-cyber.cloud",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd2026!",
  "providerSubject": "google-sub-123456789"
}

### 6. Check RBAC Permission (alert:read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/rbac-test/alert-read
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Check RBAC Role (ORG_ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/rbac-test/org-admin
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Check Tenant Scoped Permission (Org)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/rbac-test/orgs/{{orgId}}/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Organization-Id: {{orgId}}

### 9. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aegis/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
